    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare head integrity, regeneration, subsequent barium survival, and gene-expression change in chronically exposed and control planaria, testing whether regenerated heads acquire resistance with a limited transcriptional response.";
